{"t": 1794105066.7656972, "kind": "call", "tool": "gitlab_create_merge_request_thread", "args": {"body": "**Fix for the red `main` pipeline (pipeline #8812)**\n\n`test:contract` failed on `main` (a91c2e0) in `contract/test_invoice.py::test_invoice_number_format`:\n\n```\nAssertionError: assert 'INV-2026-42' == 'INV-2026-000042'\nFAILED contract/test_invoice.py::test_invoice_number_format\n```\n\n**Root cause:** `billing/invoice.py` interpolated the sequence without padding:\n\n```python\nreturn f\"INV-{year}-{seq}\"   # -> INV-2026-42\n```\n\nThe Finance ERP import contract (FIN-77) requires the sequence part to be zero-padded to 6 digits.\n\n**Fix:**\n\n```python\n def invoice_number(year: int, seq: int) -> str:\n+    # Finance ERP import (FIN-77): the sequence part is zero-padded to 6 digits.\n-    return f\"INV-{year}-{seq}\"\n+    return f\"INV-{year}-{seq:06d}\"\n```\n\n**Verification:** `invoice_number(2026, 42)` now returns `INV-2026-000042`, which satisfies the contract assertion; `lint` is unaffected by the change.\n\nNote for this MR: since it is the ERP v2 switch, the branch should keep the same six-digit padding so merging it does not reintroduce the contract failure.", "merge_request_iid": "12", "project_id": "acme/billing-legacy"}, "ok": true}
